p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8b53d9bba56d9b448661a94eca704505.poster.avif?t=1759327458\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8b53d9bba56d9b448661a94eca704505.webm?t=1759327458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Adventure &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroll through lush, handcrafted levels packed with surprises. From traps and treasures to artifacts and pooplets, <i>Seeker: Quest</i> rewards exploration. Even if your team gets wiped out, luck might help you hatch a new Seeker with perfect attributes\u2014or you\u2019ll find Orbs of Resurrection to bring your pumped-up team back into the fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf04\u00a0<strong>Get the Event Island Keys!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are unique event monsters available to catch and hatch. New event islands appear within the updates! Each season comes with an island featuring its own challenges and, ultimately, the battle against the new Seeker you need to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/e44c4f21313d13f10b2e05b62a3dbb15.poster.avif?t=1759327458\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/e44c4f21313d13f10b2e05b62a3dbb15.webm?t=1759327458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\ud83d\udcdc <strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrected by the god-like Seeker Leerking, the planet Naturia has become a paradise for Seekers. But when humans arrived, seeking the precious Sylvan Ore, a rebellion erupted, forcing the invaders back. Now, the Wild Seekers control the land, but something more sinister is at work beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jesterians, exiled rebels from the Abyss\u2014a realm of darkness beyond comprehension\u2014accidentally arrived on Naturia through a portal. Exiled from Sylvania, their once-beloved home, they endured the Abyss\u2019s horrors and survived. Now stranded on this strange planet, they must fight for survival and find a way back to their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by <strong>Ive</strong>, a fearless young leader with a vision to restore balance, the Jesterians include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draven</strong>: A former King's Guard searching for redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naman\u2019Ghal</strong>: A shaman deeply connected to the planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Azreal</strong>: A Sylvan Mage bent on revenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they must uncover the secrets of Naturia as the shadow of Leerking looms ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8579353329f0930219abcc159776eb55.avif?t=1759327458\" width=616 height=249 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Join Early Access Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Seeker: Quest</i> with <strong>60-90 minutes</strong> of exciting gameplay in Early Access. More Seekers, levels, and adventures are coming, and your feedback will help shape the world of <i>Seeker: Quest</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s time to hatch a new adventure\u2014are you ready?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers